  "_readme": "One list for every game's articles. The /coc/ strip, the /articles/ feed and its per-game pages are all built from it (article-cards.js). Publishing = write /articles/<game>/<id>.html, then set status to \"live\" and fill in date. status \"soon\" = greyed card, no link. Order here = order in the strips; the feed puts live ones first, newest date first. \"lead\": true pins that article as the big one in the /coc/ Articles section (nowhere else). id is the URL slug: never change it once live. games: every game that can have articles; \"related\" = the game shown in the bottom nav's middle-right slot on that game's article pages (game-nav.json \"articles-<game>\"). \"updated\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\" (optional) = the cards say \"Updated <Mon YYYY>\" instead of \"Published <Mon YYYY>\". No deks (dropped Oct 26 2026, Adrian). \"hub\": \"hot\" = the /articles/ Hot right now boxes in order (first = the big one), \"first\" = the grid's opening cards; the rest follow newest first. \"read\" = the article page's \"N min read\" (set it when publishing). games: \"icon\", \"tile\" (the home page's baked tile art, /icons/tiles/) and \"glow\" feed the /articles/ \"Browse by game\" tiles.",
